{"id":"98293f53034b1166","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-object-classifier-topos.md","title":"Definition — 对象分类拓扑斯","display":"Definition — 对象分类拓扑斯","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-object-classifier-topos","aliases":["14-df-object-classifier-topos"],"display":"Definition — 对象分类拓扑斯","depends_on":["[[14-df-geometric-morphism-category]]","[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","[[14-df-category-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-object-classifier-topos"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-object-classifier-topos</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 对象分类拓扑斯"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9fefe9c472fa2311\" href=\"?note=9fefe9c472fa2311\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism-category\">14-df-geometric-morphism-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e748a8b3caef6a6\" href=\"?note=2e748a8b3caef6a6\" title=\"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos\">14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c502117a84587a7c\" href=\"?note=c502117a84587a7c\" title=\"14-df-category-equivalence\">14-df-category-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-Grothendieck 拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal B)\">\\(U\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal B)\\)</span>。几何态射范畴、Grothendieck 条件和等价见所列依赖。评价函子各式对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-Grothendieck 拓扑斯 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 定义：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_0^{\\mathcal E,U}\">\\(E_0^{\\mathcal E,U}\\)</span> 的定义域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B))\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_1^{\\mathcal E,U}\">\\(E_1^{\\mathcal E,U}\\)</span> 的定义域是其箭头集；箭头采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f,g,\\alpha)\">\\((f,g,\\alpha)\\)</span> 的编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_0^{\\mathcal E,U}(f)\\coloneqq f^*(U),\\qquad E_1^{\\mathcal E,U}(f,g,\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\alpha_U.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_0^{\\mathcal E,U}(f)\\coloneqq f^*(U),\\qquad E_1^{\\mathcal E,U}(f,g,\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\alpha_U.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ev}_U^{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq(E_0^{\\mathcal E,U},E_1^{\\mathcal E,U}),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(\\mathrm{Ev}_U^{\\mathcal E},\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B),\\mathcal E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ev}_U^{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq(E_0^{\\mathcal E,U},E_1^{\\mathcal E,U}),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(\\mathrm{Ev}_U^{\\mathcal E},\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B),\\mathcal E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsObjectClassifier}(\\mathcal B,U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall\\mathcal E\\in\\mathcal V\\ (\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\mathrm{IsEquivalence}(\\mathrm{Ev}_U^{\\mathcal E})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsObjectClassifier}(\\mathcal B,U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall\\mathcal E\\in\\mathcal V\\ (\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\mathrm{IsEquivalence}(\\mathrm{Ev}_U^{\\mathcal E})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 VIII.4 pp.434–437。右侧是完整范畴 E，非其对象集 Ob(E)；泛对象 U 也必须参与实际等价。本次二参数谓词保留决定性结构，原稿无指定泛对象的单参数缩写不再使用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism-category","status":"resolved","id":"9fefe9c472fa2311","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos","status":"resolved","id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"c502117a84587a7c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category-equivalence]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"E_0^{\\mathcal E,U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B))","display":false},{"tex":"E_1^{\\mathcal E,U}","display":false},{"tex":"(f,g,\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"E_0^{\\mathcal E,U}(f)\\coloneqq f^*(U),\\qquad E_1^{\\mathcal E,U}(f,g,\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\alpha_U.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ev}_U^{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq(E_0^{\\mathcal E,U},E_1^{\\mathcal E,U}),\\qquad\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(\\mathrm{Ev}_U^{\\mathcal E},\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B),\\mathcal E).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsObjectClassifier}(\\mathcal B,U)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall\\mathcal E\\in\\mathcal V\\ (\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\mathrm{IsEquivalence}(\\mathrm{Ev}_U^{\\mathcal E})).","display":true}],"bytes":1612,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-282","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-object-classifier-topos|Definition — 对象分类拓扑斯]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-object-classifier-topos]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-283","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-object-classifier-topos|Definition — 对象分类拓扑斯]]"},{"id":"82da26f4ff841520","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["9fefe9c472fa2311","2e748a8b3caef6a6","c502117a84587a7c"]}